Description:
 linuxmuster-linuxclient7 - Package for Ubuntu clients to connect to the linuxmuster.net 7 ac
Changes:
 linuxmuster-linuxclient7 (7.4.0) lmn74; urgency=high
 .
   * Escape values in LDAP search filters (#94)
   * Prevent path traversal in sudoTools mount-share (#94)
   * Validate printer path and name in sudoTools install-printer (#94)
   * Create user homes with umask 077 (#44)
   * Fix printers not being uninstalled on logout (#93)
   * Fix onBoot hook blocking the boot process if the DC is unreachable (#61)
   * Remove deprecated "client use spnego" option from smb.conf (#94)
   * Fix GDM login screen not showing on Ubuntu 26.04 (#94)
   * Fix printers shared by multiple logged in users (#101)
   * Improve login performance (#98, #99, #100)
